: pre-wrap;\">然而火星生变，影灾横生，众人无措之际，只见她微微一笑——那我出手便是！</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「呃，科拉莉，你在写什么？该执行任务了。」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「你不觉得我的龙之重锤应当有篇无敌的介绍吗？走吧，开打！」</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">「诶，等等，我锤子忘带了！」</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"valkyrie\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-valkyrie obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器展示</h2> <ul data-target=\"skill.items\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn-list\"><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"0\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn obc-tmpl__switch-btn--active\">\n      初始外观\n    </li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"1\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn\">\n      满星外观\n    </li><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"2\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-btn\">\n      实机展示\n    </li></ul> <ul data-target=\"skill.items\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-list\" style=\"height: 529px;\"><li data-target=\"skill.items\" data-index=\"0\" class=\"obc-tmpl__switch-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-title\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/07/07/50494840/49399dbc4605b7851fd00da54d138877_4336006620013752313.png\" alt=\"\"> <span>火箭锤</span></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table style=\"border-color:#ffffff;line-height:1;font-size:16px;min-width:25px;border-collapse:collapse;\" class=\"\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\"><colgroup><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2025/07/23/50494840/0a4c33485afc8ba6803d51282cce88db_4157997986018211850.gif\" href=\"\" style=\"ve