style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【同调技能】提高敌人受到来自场上角色造成的全伤（独立加成、唯一生效）。逆命魔龙·降临！装备时为敌人施加来自自身的火易伤（独立加成）。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【通用性能】常驻点燃增伤，佩戴者具有万有之星特性时火伤提高。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【角色相性】<span style=\"color:rgba(64,64,64,1)\">逆命魔龙·降临！</span>装备且激活星之环时，为敌人施加全易伤和<span style=\"color:rgba(64,64,64,1)\">来自自身的火易伤</span>，并且提高自身点燃积蓄值的附加效率。</p></div> <!----></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
